---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={`About — ${SITE_TITLE}`}
			description="Mager is a software engineer in Chicago building AI agents, developer tools, and cooking dinner."
		/>
		<style>
			:root {
				--paper: #faf6f0;
				--paper-2: #f3ede4;
				--ink: #171722;
				--muted: #596171;
				--line: rgba(23, 23, 34, 0.1);
				--indigo: #6366f1;
				--teal: #0f766e;
				--amber: #b45309;
			}

			body {
				background:
					radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.07), transparent 30%),
					radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.06), transparent 26%),
					var(--paper);
				color: var(--ink);
			}

			main {
				max-width: 980px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 1.5rem 1rem 5rem;
			}

			.about-stack {
				display: grid;
				gap: 1rem;
			}

			.card {
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.56);
				backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
				-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
				border: 1px solid var(--line);
				border-radius: 24px;
				box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(23, 23, 34, 0.06);
			}

			.hero {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(260px, 0.85fr);
				gap: 1.25rem;
				padding: 1.25rem;
			}

			.eyebrow {
				margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
				font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
				font-size: 0.72rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				letter-spacing: 0.14em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				color: var(--muted);
			}

			.headline {
				margin: 0;
				font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
				font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);
				line-height: 0.96;
				letter-spacing: -0.04em;
				color: #111018;
			}

			.headline em {
				color: var(--indigo);
				font-style: italic;
			}

			.standfirst {
				margin: 1rem 0 0;
				max-width: 36rem;
				font-family: 'Atkinson Hyperlegible', 'Atkinson', sans-serif;
				font-size: 1.02rem;
				line-height: 1.72;
				color: var(--muted);
			}

			.photo-wrap {
				position: relative;
				border-radius: 20px;
				overflow: hidden;
				background: linear-gradient(145deg, #e7e4ff 0%, #cff7ef 100%);
				min-height: 100%;
			}

			.photo-wrap img {
				width: 100%;
				height: 100%;
				min-height: 300px;
				object-fit: cover;
				object-position: center 18%;
				display: block;
			}

			.photo-tag {
				position: absolute;
				left: 0.9rem;
				bottom: 0.9rem;
				padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
				border-radius: 999px;
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
				font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
				font-size: 0.82rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				color: var(--ink);
			}

			.grid {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
				gap: 1rem;
			}

			.panel {
				padding: 1.1rem;
				position: relative;
				overflow: hidden;
			}

			.panel::before {
				content: '';
				position: absolute;
				left: 0;
				top: 0;
				bottom: 0;
				width: 4px;
				background: var(--accent, var(--indigo));
			}

			.panel.tech {
				--accent: var(--indigo);
			}

			.panel.life {
				--accent: var(--teal);
			}

			.panel.cooking {
				--accent: var(--amber);
			}

			.panel-title {
				margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
				font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
				font-size: 0.95rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				color: var(--ink);
			}

			.prose {
				font-family: 'Atkinson Hyperlegible', 'Atkinson', sans-serif;
				font-size: 0.98rem;
				line-height: 1.7;
				color: var(--muted);
			}

			.prose p {
				margin: 0;
			}

			.chips {
				display: flex;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
				gap: 0.55rem;
				margin-top: 1rem;
			}

			.chip {
				display: inline-flex;
				align-items: center;
				padding: 0.42rem 0.78rem;
				border-radius: 999px;
				font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
				font-size: 0.78rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				border: 1px solid transparent;
			}

			.chip.indigo {
				background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
				color: var(--indigo);
				border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.14);
			}

			.chip.teal {
				background: rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.1);
				color: var(--teal);
				border-color: rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.14);
			}

			.chip.amber {
				background: rgba(180, 83, 9, 0.1);
				color: var(--amber);
				border-color: rgba(180, 83, 9, 0.14);
			}

			.links {
				display: flex;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
				gap: 0.75rem;
				margin-top: 1rem;
			}

			.link-pill {
				display: inline-flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				padding: 0.72rem 1rem;
				border-radius: 999px;
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
				border: 1px solid var(--line);
				font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
				font-size: 0.86rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				color: var(--ink);
				text-decoration: none;
			}

			.link-pill:hover {
				border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.22);
			}

			@media (max-width: 900px) {
				.hero {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
					padding: 1.25rem;
				}

				.grid {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
				}

				.photo-wrap {
					order: -1;
					min-height: unset;
					height: 220px;
					background: linear-gradient(145deg, #e7e4ff 0%, #cff7ef 100%);
				}

				.photo-wrap img {
					min-height: unset;
					height: 220px;
					object-fit: contain;
					object-position: center bottom;
				}
			}

			@media (max-width: 720px) {
				main {
					padding: 0.9rem 0.8rem calc(92px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0));
				}

				.card {
					border-radius: 20px;
				}

				.hero,
				.panel {
					padding: 1rem;
				}

				.headline {
					font-size: clamp(2rem, 10vw, 3rem);
				}

				.standfirst,
				.prose {
					font-size: 0.96rem;
					line-height: 1.65;
				}

				.links {
					display: grid;
					grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
					gap: 0.6rem;
				}

				.links a:first-child {
					grid-column: 1 / -1;
				}

				.link-pill {
					width: 100%;
					text-align: center;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header homepage={true} />
		<main>
			<div class="about-stack">
				<section class="card hero">
					<div>
						<p class="eyebrow">About</p>
						<h1 class="headline">Hi, I’m <em>Mager</em>.</h1>
						<p class="standfirst">
							I’m a software engineer in Chicago. I build AI agents, developer tools, and weird internet products,
							then write about what actually worked, what broke, and what I learned along the way.
						</p>
						<div class="chips">
							<span class="chip indigo">AI agents</span>
							<span class="chip indigo">Developer tools</span>
							<span class="chip teal">Chicago</span>
							<span class="chip amber">Home cook</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="photo-wrap">
						<img src="/images/mager.jpg" alt="Mager" />
						<div class="photo-tag">mager.co</div>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="grid">
					<div class="card panel tech">
						<h2 class="panel-title">Tech</h2>
						<div class="prose">
							<p>
								Most of what I care about right now sits around agents, context, and software that feels alive.
								I’m interested in the practical layer, not just the demo layer: harnesses, memory, evals, workflows,
								and how you make AI actually useful inside a real product stack.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="card panel life">
						<h2 class="panel-title">Life</h2>
						<div class="prose">
							<p>
								Outside of code, I post the occasional travel note, family story, or thing I want to remember, but the center of gravity here is still building.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="card panel cooking">
						<h2 class="panel-title">Cooking</h2>
						<div class="prose">
							<p>
								I cook constantly. Soups, braises, rice, pasta, whatever I’m iterating on that week. Cooking and software scratch the same itch for me, small decisions compounding into something better when you pay attention.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="card panel life">
					<h2 class="panel-title">Elsewhere</h2>
					<div class="prose">
						<p>
							You can find the projects on GitHub, the shorter thoughts on X, and the longer version of me in the posts here.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="links">
						<a class="link-pill" href="/blog">Read the blog</a>
						<a class="link-pill" href="https://github.com/mager" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a>
						<a class="link-pill" href="https://x.com/mager" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">X</a>
						<a class="link-pill" href="https://loooom.xyz/me/mager" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">ME.md</a>
					</div>
				</section>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
